{"unit_id":"kyle123740__dsh-message-recall#card-zh","repo":"kyle123740/dsh-message-recall","commit":"1999cee7b9d48015a36c85b7ebf6174c24cc15a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Message Recall 是面向 Web 客户端的会话管理插件，在每条对话消息上提供悬停操作，可撤回自己发出的提示词、删除单条消息，或从指定位置删除后续内容。它通过 DSH 会话 surface 追加墓碑事件，让被移除内容不再进入后续模型上下文，并在界面同步隐藏对应消息；删除模型回复时会连同同一步骤的工具结果处理。撤回用户消息会把原文放回输入框，便于修改后重发。适合需要修正误发提示词、整理回答或截断错误对话的 DSH 用户。操作需要会话处于运行状态，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:171-239","lib/client.js:380-422"]}
{"unit_id":"kyle123740__dsh-message-recall#card-en","repo":"kyle123740/dsh-message-recall","commit":"1999cee7b9d48015a36c85b7ebf6174c24cc15a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Message Recall lets web users recall a prompt, delete a message, or truncate a conversation. Tombstones remove messages from later model context and hide their rows; deleting an answer includes its step’s tool results. Recall restores the prompt. Requires an active session.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/main.js:171-239","lib/client.js:380-422"]}
